{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your very own warm and friendly intergalactic city in the cold vacuum of space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expect close encounters of the third, fourth, and maybe even fifth kind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Aim to become the most desirable city in the galaxy by developing land so you can build shops and bases for your residents to live in comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build Convenience Stores and Parks to make daily life easier, or Takoyaki Stalls and Cinemas to bring in tourists and keep people entertained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find the perfect combination of facilities to astronomically boost the city's charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As you explore your new world, you'll encounter all kinds of monsters native to the planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stay one step ahead of them by upgrading your Fighter Aircraft and training up your pilots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And who knows, maybe you'll even make a few new friends along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With the help of your newfound alien friends, hold outdoor events to bring in tourists from all over the galaxy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Utilize a state-of-the-art autopilot system to help you fight through grueling space battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can also give orders to your pilots to guide them to glorious victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > So, do you think you have what it takes to build the best city in the entire galaxy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Jump in the pilot's seat and begin your adventure into the unknown to find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try searching for &quot;Kairosoft&quot; to see all of our games!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 